[
    {
        "content": "<p>Can someone enlighten me what happens here:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">eval</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vectorAddComm</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p><code>eval</code> tells that both vector sums are equal, whereas the <code>rfl</code> tactics says that both sums are not definitionally equal.</p>",
        "id": 593974385,
        "sender_full_name": "thielema",
        "timestamp": 1778329344
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I don't think <code>#eval</code> tells you anything about defeq. Try this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">synth</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Decidable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>which tells you that <code>#eval</code> knows the truth value of that proposition using <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=instDecidableEqVector#doc\">docs#instDecidableEqVector</a>, which probably contains a proof that's more complicated than <code>rfl</code></p>",
        "id": 593975610,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1778330091
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>It looks like it uses <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/3dc1a088b6d2d8eafe25a7cd7ec7b58d731bd7cc/src/Init/Data/Array/DecidableEq.lean#L104-L113\">this recursive algorithm</a> (which is the obvious algorithm) + decidable equality on naturals (which is <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/3dc1a088b6d2d8eafe25a7cd7ec7b58d731bd7cc/src/Init/Prelude.lean#L1797-L1808\">also recursive</a>), so no defeq.<br>\n(technically there are probably faster alternative algs that <code>#eval</code> actually runs since I believe it runs IR, but since the question is about a rfl proof it's irrelevant)</p>",
        "id": 593976346,
        "sender_full_name": "Snir Broshi",
        "timestamp": 1778330634
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">semireducible</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Array</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zipWithMAux</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vectorAddComm</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 593977364,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1778331306
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vectorAddComm</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">with_unfolding_all</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 593977456,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1778331366
    },
    {
        "content": "<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vectorAddComm</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">decide</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 593977482,
        "sender_full_name": "Aaron Liu",
        "timestamp": 1778331381
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I think</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">def</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">vectorAddComm</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">#</span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cbv</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>is what you're supposed to use nowadays.</p>",
        "id": 593977496,
        "sender_full_name": "Robin Arnez",
        "timestamp": 1778331391
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>The reason I ask is: I have these vectors as type arguments in types and I want the types <code>#v[1, 0, 0] + #v[0, 0, 1]</code> and <code>#v[0, 0, 1] + #v[1, 0, 0]</code> to be compatible.</p>",
        "id": 593987435,
        "sender_full_name": "thielema",
        "timestamp": 1778337659
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>On lists, rfl works. Also when converting the vectors to lists.</p>",
        "id": 593991609,
        "sender_full_name": "thielema",
        "timestamp": 1778340599
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Can you un- <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XY_problem\">#xy</a>? I think probably the answer is that you need to introduce a casting function.</p>",
        "id": 593991856,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1778340766
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>On lists there is no + operator, is there?</p>",
        "id": 593991865,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1778340776
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>What do you mean with un-#xy?</p>\n<p>On lists this succeeds:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">lemma</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zipWith</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Add</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zipWith</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Add</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rfl</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
        "id": 594004474,
        "sender_full_name": "thielema",
        "timestamp": 1778349176
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XY_problem\">#xy</a> is a link, in case you missed it</p>",
        "id": 594004600,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1778349258
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>In plain English, I'd translate \"un-#xy\" to \"I believe you might be having an XY problem; can you explain what led you to this question so we can help you solve the actual problem (instead of answering this question which might not have a satisfactory answer).\"</p>",
        "id": 594005356,
        "sender_full_name": "Michael Rothgang",
        "timestamp": 1778349667
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>(apologies for being cryptic, and thanks Michael!)</p>",
        "id": 594006416,
        "sender_full_name": "Eric Wieser",
        "timestamp": 1778350245
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>I see. The bigger picture is, I want to represent a physical quantity by combining a number with physical dimensions on the type level, like so:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">structure</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Quantity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">{</span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">v</span><span class=\"o\">}</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">d</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">number</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span>\n<span class=\"n\">deriving</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Repr</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Add</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Quantity</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">a</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dim</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">where</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span>